igned tablet servers, locking the tables, sharding (splitting of a single table amongst multiple tablet servers for storage effectiveness), health-checking for tablet servers through heartbeat, recovery (handle the permanent loss of a tablet server) based on WAL (write-ahead log) and metadata, and start/kill the servers. The tablet servers support garbage collection (only keep the last five inserted values), maintaining the memtable for effective searching (memtable would spilled to disk when there are a hundred unique row keys exists), maintaining the in-memory indexes, sharding when a table contains more than 1000 row keys, WAL, reconstructing the tablet server state using WAL and SSTables maintained in the persistent storage, effective range searching in SSTables.","topics":[],"score":259621,"global_rank":50381,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9317},{"name":"SiqiD47/vision2019","owner":"SiqiD47","html_url":"https://github.com/SiqiD47/vision2019","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":259613,"global_rank":50390,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9318},{"name":"hcrlab/PR2-usr-lib-robot","owner":"hcrlab","html_url":"https://github.com/hcrlab/PR2-usr-lib-robot","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":36,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Repository to keep track of modifications to the PR2's robot.py","topics":[],"score":259608,"global_rank":50398,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9319},{"name":"albertomurillo/leetcode","owner":"albertomurillo","html_url":"https://github.com/albertomurillo/leetcode","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":259608,"global_rank":50399,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9320},{"name":"hileamlakB/Pytorch-scheduler","owner":"hileamlakB","html_url":"https://github.com/hileamlakB/Pytorch-scheduler","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","de